[en.FOCUS_C01_SCIENCE_CONSERVATIVE]
Conservative Innovation

[en.FOCUS_C01_SCIENCE_CONSERVATIVE_desc]
Conservation and innovation sound contradictory, but the Empire’s “Conservative Innovation” policy is obviously not - the Empire only needs the dividends brought by innovation, not the risks. So we need to monitor all scientific research closely to ensure that the general direction of the magic and scientific innovation is conservative enough.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_SCIENCE_CONSERVATIVE]
保守创新

[zh.FOCUS_C01_SCIENCE_CONSERVATIVE_desc]
保守和创新听上去是自相矛盾的，但帝国的“保守创新”政策显然不是——帝国只需要创新带来的红利，而不需要任何创新带来的风险，因此我们需要对所有科学研究进行严密监视，以确保魔法和科学创新的大方向是足够保守的。

